WEBVTT

00:00:36.209 --> 00:00:40.180
After all that we've been through,
we can't stay in Bow City any more.

00:00:41.417 --> 00:00:44.417
This town is basically
taken over by the Black Curia.

00:01:05.509 --> 00:01:06.549
Mo Fan.

00:01:06.706 --> 00:01:09.123
I will follow you,
where are we headed to?

00:01:09.789 --> 00:01:10.589
Mingzhu City.

00:01:12.552 --> 00:01:15.592
♪ When this moment come to us ♪

00:01:15.614 --> 00:01:17.983
♪ The Stars will always shine ♪
[Full-Time Magister 3]

00:01:18.417 --> 00:01:22.251
♪ The light travels through
the horizon to you ♪

00:01:22.283 --> 00:01:24.610
♪ Right now light it up
follow your heart, yeah ♪

00:01:34.387 --> 00:01:37.363
♪ Our dream of madness is rattling ♪

00:01:37.364 --> 00:01:39.359
♪ Just cause you feel it possible ♪

00:01:39.411 --> 00:01:43.905
♪ My eyes will open wide in
this cold, dark night ♪

00:01:44.486 --> 00:01:47.122
♪ The heart bound by time
is just a shackle ♪

00:01:47.123 --> 00:01:49.273
♪ You said that dreams will never fall ♪

00:01:49.274 --> 00:01:52.532
♪ You put on the wings for me ♪

00:01:52.562 --> 00:01:56.694
♪ Braving through the wind ♪

00:01:58.229 --> 00:02:01.013
♪ When this moment come to us ♪

00:02:01.025 --> 00:02:03.325
♪ My heart will no longer be lost ♪

00:02:03.902 --> 00:02:08.039
♪ I carry the weight of stars
and moon as I search for you ♪

00:02:08.065 --> 00:02:10.465
♪ You summon me from the dream ♪

00:02:10.466 --> 00:02:13.514
♪ My ambition is burning on ♪

00:02:13.515 --> 00:02:16.138
♪ You are the hope of light
in my darkest night ♪

00:02:16.139 --> 00:02:17.733
♪ On the other end of shine ♪

00:02:17.734 --> 00:02:20.252
♪ Let it all out and fight ♪

00:02:20.253 --> 00:02:23.374
♪ Shine bright like it's
the end of the world ♪

00:02:23.459 --> 00:02:25.918
♪ The Stars is burning through the sky ♪

00:02:25.934 --> 00:02:27.804
♪ You hands are now ♪

00:02:27.805 --> 00:02:29.338
♪ Burning ♪

00:02:29.686 --> 00:02:33.377
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:02:34.622 --> 00:02:38.590
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:02:39.444 --> 00:02:42.058
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:02:47.205 --> 00:02:51.083
Xinxia, what if monsters appear
on the route of this train?

00:02:51.521 --> 00:02:53.974
The railway is protected by barriers.

00:02:54.877 --> 00:02:56.057
That is good to know.

00:02:56.618 --> 00:02:59.191
It feels like you have
travelled through time.

00:02:59.405 --> 00:03:01.713
-There are so much that you don't know.
-Indeed.

00:03:02.888 --> 00:03:04.995
I came from a world of science.

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:07.292
All the phenomenons can
be explained by science.

00:03:07.542 --> 00:03:09.501
Magic is nothing but
superstition in my world.

00:03:10.721 --> 00:03:13.220
-Hahaha!
-Don't be ridiculous.

00:03:14.145 --> 00:03:16.785
Without the discovery
by brilliant minds,

00:03:16.870 --> 00:03:18.723
your life wouldn't be comfortable right now.

00:03:18.723 --> 00:03:20.490
Leave alone this bullet train,

00:03:20.883 --> 00:03:24.988
which is a massive locomotive powered
by the magic from Thunder Talent.

00:03:25.042 --> 00:03:27.308
You have no respect for the history at all.

00:03:27.702 --> 00:03:31.158
Sir, my son like to
babble about weird things,

00:03:31.278 --> 00:03:32.307
I hope you are not offended.

00:03:32.577 --> 00:03:35.136
Sir, judging by your tone,

00:03:35.267 --> 00:03:37.093
are you a professor?

00:03:38.195 --> 00:03:40.768
I am the history professor of
Mingzhu Academy.

00:03:40.876 --> 00:03:42.085
Mingzhu Academy?

00:03:42.292 --> 00:03:46.043
That is the dream
University of all mages!

00:03:46.125 --> 00:03:48.542
Sir, is there any special admission
programme there?

00:03:49.209 --> 00:03:52.510
-You want to get into the university?
-That was my original plan.

00:03:53.308 --> 00:03:55.954
They do have special admission,
but you should forget it.

00:03:55.975 --> 00:03:58.908
The admission requirements are
too high for your standard.

00:03:59.345 --> 00:04:02.079
To stand out from
thousands of candidates,

00:04:02.148 --> 00:04:03.922
you need to be more than unique.

00:04:07.681 --> 00:04:09.161
I am a Nebula mage.

00:04:09.259 --> 00:04:12.491
I must join an organization that can
give me a chance of second awakening.

00:04:13.734 --> 00:04:15.668
That is the only way to get
admitted into the university.

00:04:16.875 --> 00:04:19.048
The next stop is the Mingzhu Terminal.

00:04:19.100 --> 00:04:21.642
Please get your luggages
before leaving the train.

00:04:27.103 --> 00:04:30.409
I am glad Mingzhu City can provide
the refugees of Bow City with houses.

00:04:30.649 --> 00:04:32.943
Otherwise we would be homeless.

00:04:34.886 --> 00:04:35.820
Come in.

00:04:52.206 --> 00:04:56.081
I thought Mingzhu City is
full of tall buildings,

00:04:56.494 --> 00:04:57.814
but this is just a barren land.

00:04:58.668 --> 00:05:01.162
At least we made it through
the disaster of Bow City.

00:05:01.203 --> 00:05:01.950
Right?

00:05:03.246 --> 00:05:04.619
Have you decided which school to attend?

00:05:04.785 --> 00:05:06.065
I am planning to home-school myself.

00:05:06.163 --> 00:05:07.856
I will join the Mage
Aptitude Test next year.

00:05:09.999 --> 00:05:12.122
You are a mage with Healing Talent.

00:05:12.162 --> 00:05:13.754
There is a high demand
for this kind of mage.

00:05:13.755 --> 00:05:15.501
What is your plan?

00:05:15.502 --> 00:05:16.321
To have a job.

00:05:16.517 --> 00:05:18.749
Once I have enough money,
I will get you a better life.

00:05:19.342 --> 00:05:21.422
There will be a life for us anyway.

00:05:21.954 --> 00:05:23.594
I may not know this society very well,

00:05:23.864 --> 00:05:27.442
but I do know that prestigious family
make sure their children excel...

00:05:27.629 --> 00:05:30.224
by using all of their resources.
They spend a fortune for that.

00:05:30.607 --> 00:05:32.887
But you have to work hard on your own.

00:05:33.353 --> 00:05:35.073
But I know you will come out on top.

00:05:35.598 --> 00:05:38.674
I hope you can follow
your heart on this.

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:40.287
To become the greatest mage.

00:05:46.027 --> 00:05:48.521
The most basic magic require
the connecting of seven Stars.

00:05:49.042 --> 00:05:51.292
Then it's ten times harder in
the Starchart level.

00:05:51.762 --> 00:05:53.695
I must connect the Orbits
into a Starchart.

00:05:53.915 --> 00:05:55.782
That is the only way to
unlock the Mage's Gate.

00:05:57.018 --> 00:05:59.441
Little Eel, I am counting on you.

00:05:59.866 --> 00:06:03.650
You consumed the Sacred Spring and
is now an advanced magical gear!

00:06:07.030 --> 00:06:08.961
Okay, it's time for meditation.

00:06:13.471 --> 00:06:15.108
I am only a Nebula mage,

00:06:15.255 --> 00:06:18.704
connecting all the 49 Stars
without an error...

00:06:19.086 --> 00:06:21.646
is almost impossible for me!

00:06:31.430 --> 00:06:33.097
Buying these two Spell Scrolls...

00:06:33.388 --> 00:06:36.839
costed me the 100,000 yuan I earned
from working with City Hunters.

00:06:37.771 --> 00:06:40.495
I must use the meditation
and gain control of the Stars.

00:06:45.391 --> 00:06:46.151
Hello, who is it?

00:06:46.184 --> 00:06:47.425
Hello? Mo Fan?

00:06:48.167 --> 00:06:49.470
Miss Tang Yue?

00:06:49.972 --> 00:06:51.772
I was worried about you when
the city was under attack.

00:06:53.144 --> 00:06:55.331
Why do you call me out of the sudden?

00:06:55.732 --> 00:06:57.225
I want to ask you a favor.

00:06:57.590 --> 00:07:00.428
I am in an old town named Xishui,
it's next to Song City.

00:07:01.154 --> 00:07:03.456
Why don't come by
and let's talk about it?

00:07:04.651 --> 00:07:05.638
Xishui?

00:07:07.062 --> 00:07:08.049
Are you coming or not?

00:07:08.231 --> 00:07:09.596
Sure, of course.

00:07:21.542 --> 00:07:24.293
And they call this town Xishui ?

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:49.750
Miss Tang Yue,
you are gorgeous as always.

00:07:50.501 --> 00:07:51.355
You are doing well too.

00:07:51.550 --> 00:07:53.830
You are already a Nebula mage
at a young age.

00:07:53.988 --> 00:07:56.135
But I can't control
the Starchart yet.

00:07:56.353 --> 00:07:59.907
You just advanced into Nebula stage,
it's hard to control your Starchart.

00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:03.057
You need to make sure the Orbits
connections do not break...

00:08:03.109 --> 00:08:04.410
while opening new ones.

00:08:04.781 --> 00:08:08.097
A single mistake and you might end
up with an odd Starchart.

00:08:08.375 --> 00:08:10.584
Thanks to the Book of
Starchart you gave me,

00:08:10.776 --> 00:08:13.242
I managed to get away from Bow City.

00:08:13.963 --> 00:08:16.030
But you are giving me the book
just like that?

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:19.542
I think you are more
than just a Nebula mage.

00:08:20.880 --> 00:08:24.052
You want to know more about
the disaster at Bow City, right?

00:08:25.517 --> 00:08:27.664
Do you know the Holy Court of
Association of Magical Societies?

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:30.966
They say it's an organization that
arrests mages that break the laws.

00:08:31.675 --> 00:08:33.021
I am one of them.

00:08:33.199 --> 00:08:35.986
In fact, we were aware of
the Black Curia's plan...

00:08:36.059 --> 00:08:37.366
in Bow City.

00:08:37.686 --> 00:08:38.633
But unfortunately,

00:08:39.042 --> 00:08:41.584
we didn't expect them to have
such a thoughtful plan.

00:08:42.083 --> 00:08:44.959
I was trying to catch a guy
named Salang from the Black Curia.

00:08:45.844 --> 00:08:47.124
But my effort was futile.

00:08:47.766 --> 00:08:50.177
Now, the higher-up of the Holy Court
is taking over the case.

00:08:50.626 --> 00:08:52.960
They will give Bow City
the justice it deserves.

00:08:54.082 --> 00:08:56.313
Right, why do you want to meet me?

00:08:56.748 --> 00:08:58.321
Here was supposed
to be a village with river,

00:08:58.375 --> 00:09:00.517
but all the water dried up.

00:09:01.471 --> 00:09:03.418
I am here to investigate the case.

00:09:03.583 --> 00:09:04.930
My identity makes it
inconvenient for me.

00:09:05.066 --> 00:09:07.026
So, I need you help
in the investigation.

00:09:07.578 --> 00:09:08.925
Follow that man in the hood.

00:09:09.281 --> 00:09:11.781
If my guess is right,
he might have the answer we need.

00:09:11.848 --> 00:09:13.114
Is there anything wrong with that man?

00:09:13.248 --> 00:09:14.888
He is a mage with evil thoughts.

00:09:15.376 --> 00:09:17.069
He is known as Chao He the Butcher.

00:09:17.939 --> 00:09:19.739
He killed as many mage
as monsters do.

00:09:20.331 --> 00:09:22.171
Why would you need me
for a job so risky?

00:09:22.473 --> 00:09:24.996
If you help me out this time,
you can ask anything from me.

00:09:26.039 --> 00:09:26.892
The Crystal Ball?

00:09:28.284 --> 00:09:29.151
Fine.

00:09:30.305 --> 00:09:32.532
Use these Books of Starchart
for your protection.

00:09:33.202 --> 00:09:35.829
I will awaken your Shadow Talent
for you when the job is done.

00:09:37.045 --> 00:09:39.152
Miss Tang Yue,
your wish is my command!

00:09:40.848 --> 00:09:42.555
I'll start following that man.

00:09:42.585 --> 00:09:44.785
I'll find out everything
there is about him.

00:09:52.967 --> 00:09:54.060
Sir.

00:09:55.037 --> 00:09:56.717
Why is the land all dried up?

00:09:58.136 --> 00:09:59.483
Who knows?

00:09:59.565 --> 00:10:02.219
I only remember that it
happened around ten days ago.

00:10:02.707 --> 00:10:05.947
The stream started to
dry up like it's magic.

00:10:06.107 --> 00:10:07.329
Oh, I see.

00:10:08.125 --> 00:10:09.059
Young man.

00:10:09.192 --> 00:10:10.826
You shouldn't go there.

00:10:10.887 --> 00:10:13.194
I heard the place is
burning hot right now.

00:10:13.262 --> 00:10:14.915
The temperature is too high.

00:10:14.968 --> 00:10:15.822
I'll be fine.

00:10:23.567 --> 00:10:26.300
He doesn't look like some
kind of villain to me.

00:10:26.658 --> 00:10:28.578
Did Miss Tang Yue get the wrong man?

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:31.880
Why is he going upstream?

00:10:31.987 --> 00:10:32.789
Now is our chance.

00:10:32.895 --> 00:10:35.066
-We need to follow him now.
-Who is there?

00:10:36.908 --> 00:10:39.135
Miss Tang Yue, you scared me!

00:10:40.628 --> 00:10:42.175
What is so amazing about Shadow Talent?

00:10:42.254 --> 00:10:43.453
Just creeping around.

00:10:48.005 --> 00:10:49.045
Where is Chao He?

00:10:49.396 --> 00:10:50.370
Where did he go?

00:10:52.697 --> 00:10:56.042
The old farmer said the
drought started half a month ago,

00:10:56.125 --> 00:10:59.500
but the soil looks like it's
been dry for one whole year.

00:11:01.417 --> 00:11:02.417
Hold your breath.

00:11:09.981 --> 00:11:13.353
Trust me, there must be
Fire Spirit around here.

00:11:13.672 --> 00:11:15.507
Pan Xiong, don't trick me.

00:11:15.967 --> 00:11:17.380
The information could be true.

00:11:17.423 --> 00:11:19.090
If this were a drought,

00:11:19.117 --> 00:11:22.694
the land couldn't have
dried up so quickly.

00:11:22.695 --> 00:11:25.189
Haha! We are going to be rich this time.

00:11:26.814 --> 00:11:29.307
A Fire Spirit? What is that?

00:11:32.710 --> 00:11:35.675
The elements are born from the nature.
In some special places,

00:11:35.821 --> 00:11:37.455
a sentient sparks can be born.

00:11:38.352 --> 00:11:41.509
The sparks can increase the power
of a mage tremendously.

00:11:41.975 --> 00:11:43.161
A tremendous increase?

00:11:43.350 --> 00:11:46.423
The most common Fire Spirit
could go up to 20 million in price.

00:11:46.755 --> 00:11:49.641
That is why that thug is willing
to wander around here.

00:11:49.793 --> 00:11:51.806
He is here to catch the
Fire Spirit for himself.

00:11:51.820 --> 00:11:53.498
My goodness, that is a lot of money!

00:11:54.403 --> 00:11:56.088
Right, if I remember correctly,

00:11:56.209 --> 00:11:58.751
Mu Ningxue was born with
something like that.

00:12:00.459 --> 00:12:03.085
Some families are born with Spirits.

00:12:03.547 --> 00:12:05.680
Their power is stronger
than average people.

00:12:06.173 --> 00:12:08.013
So, there is no chance
for grass-root like me.

00:12:11.195 --> 00:12:14.791
Your Talents are quite the show too.
You are born with an extra Talent.

00:12:15.097 --> 00:12:16.417
If we must say,

00:12:16.598 --> 00:12:19.632
your Double Talents are even more
adored than Mu Ningxue's spirit.

00:12:20.702 --> 00:12:23.089
That sounds nice enough
to calm my nerve.

00:12:23.317 --> 00:12:24.331
But it comes with a cost.

00:12:27.558 --> 00:12:29.825
The time and resource
you need for training...

00:12:29.859 --> 00:12:30.966
are much longer as well.

00:12:31.436 --> 00:12:33.450
In other word, you need to
spend a lot of money.

00:12:35.358 --> 00:12:36.411
Miss Tang Yue,

00:12:36.735 --> 00:12:39.459
you could have save that
for other time.

00:12:40.098 --> 00:12:43.821
Honestly, you should join an faction
that has a lot of resources.

00:12:44.029 --> 00:12:45.629
Let them pay for your expanses.

00:12:47.564 --> 00:12:49.955
Miss Tang Yue, why don't
you make me your boyfriend?

00:12:50.076 --> 00:12:51.813
If that happens, I can do anything...

00:12:51.814 --> 00:12:53.162
that you want.

00:12:57.735 --> 00:12:58.362
Don't worry,

00:12:58.720 --> 00:13:01.446
there will be plenty of hard labour
soon enough.

00:13:13.769 --> 00:13:14.794
Someone are here.

00:13:16.718 --> 00:13:17.812
Disappeared again.

00:13:18.245 --> 00:13:20.768
Stay alert, they are from
the Dongfang family.

00:13:21.585 --> 00:13:24.639
Pan Xiong, if you don't want
to end up being a beggar in Song City,

00:13:24.725 --> 00:13:26.765
take your men and get our of here.

00:13:27.072 --> 00:13:29.880
Dongfang Jun, get in the line.

00:13:30.930 --> 00:13:32.957
If the Dongfang family wants something,

00:13:33.167 --> 00:13:34.626
they don't need your permission.

00:13:36.209 --> 00:13:37.793
Where did the Butcher go?

00:13:38.020 --> 00:13:39.740
Chao He, isn't it?

00:13:39.816 --> 00:13:41.188
He might be hiding somewhere,

00:13:41.281 --> 00:13:45.098
waiting for them to start a fight
and get away with the Spirit.

00:13:45.134 --> 00:13:46.667
What do we do now?

00:13:46.886 --> 00:13:48.700
We will wait for our opportunity.

00:13:49.402 --> 00:13:51.141
They are starting a fight!

00:13:55.870 --> 00:13:57.777
All four of them are Nebula mages?

00:13:57.884 --> 00:13:59.124
They are no pushovers.

00:13:59.257 --> 00:14:01.378
Stay back, don't get caught
up in the cross fire.

00:14:03.017 --> 00:14:05.726
This is Shadow Shift.
The basic skill of Shadow Talent.

00:14:24.248 --> 00:14:25.368
They are Nebula mages,

00:14:25.488 --> 00:14:27.641
but they are only using basic spells.

00:14:29.204 --> 00:14:30.511
They are not as strong
as other Nebula mages,

00:14:30.551 --> 00:14:32.118
but the speed is incredible.

00:14:32.857 --> 00:14:33.857
Cover me!

00:14:33.937 --> 00:14:36.711
I will let them have a taste
of my Fiery Fist!

00:14:43.718 --> 00:14:45.011
Fiery Fist!

00:14:45.918 --> 00:14:47.144
Sky High!

00:14:53.162 --> 00:14:55.056
Earth Wall, Ground Spike!

00:14:57.210 --> 00:14:59.078
Earth Wall, the Starchart magic
of Earth Talent.

00:14:59.375 --> 00:15:01.625
The strongest defensive spell
in the early Nebula stage.

00:15:02.072 --> 00:15:03.338
That's something new to me.

00:15:04.300 --> 00:15:05.114
Wind Shroud,

00:15:05.786 --> 00:15:06.719
Twister!

00:15:14.672 --> 00:15:16.668
Compared to the basic Wind magic,

00:15:16.707 --> 00:15:20.025
the Starchart wind magic is
way too violent!

00:15:21.436 --> 00:15:23.460
Quick, defensive magical gears!

00:15:38.715 --> 00:15:39.662
Damn it!

00:16:03.677 --> 00:16:06.163
I am showing some courtesy
to the Hunters' League.

00:16:06.260 --> 00:16:08.577
Get out of here now
before I turn you into ashes.

00:16:09.432 --> 00:16:13.396
The Holy Court won't find any
evidence even if they come here.

00:16:15.665 --> 00:16:16.678
Let's go.

00:16:20.706 --> 00:16:22.066
Why did you let them go?

00:16:22.744 --> 00:16:25.985
We have suffer heavy casualty if this
turns into a long battle.

00:16:26.315 --> 00:16:28.075
I almost used up my Nebula.

00:16:28.820 --> 00:16:29.966
Start collecting.

00:16:30.266 --> 00:16:31.947
These are all mine now.

00:16:32.154 --> 00:16:33.461
You will get your share later on.

00:16:34.350 --> 00:16:37.049
Excuse me, the treasure is mine now.

00:16:37.786 --> 00:16:39.653
If I am in a good mood,

00:16:40.049 --> 00:16:42.815
I might grant you a swift death.

00:16:44.051 --> 00:16:44.931
Chao He!

00:16:52.415 --> 00:16:56.161
♪ Until we start to fight keep alive ♪

00:16:56.209 --> 00:16:59.418
♪ No matter what they said
you must believe in yourself ♪

00:16:59.459 --> 00:17:02.418
♪ You will breaking through the night ♪

00:17:02.459 --> 00:17:05.043
♪ Fire in your eyes shining so bright ♪

00:17:09.709 --> 00:17:11.959
♪ Every lonely journey I begin ♪

00:17:11.970 --> 00:17:14.030
♪ Is another mystery
this life gives me ♪

00:17:14.069 --> 00:17:16.184
♪ I can't escape my fate, but why? ♪

00:17:16.219 --> 00:17:19.452
♪ Who tipped the balance
of this season? ♪

00:17:19.942 --> 00:17:24.720
♪ Is the crushing blow necessary
for one to rise up and see? ♪

00:17:24.747 --> 00:17:27.387
♪ Fight on in this uphill battle ♪

00:17:27.388 --> 00:17:29.665
♪ Face the reality ♪

00:17:29.686 --> 00:17:32.379
♪ Setting foot in this forbidden city ♪

00:17:32.406 --> 00:17:35.711
♪ Breaking the rules that silence me ♪

00:17:36.449 --> 00:17:39.193
♪ The more I go against it,
the more certain I am ♪

00:17:39.194 --> 00:17:41.308
♪ As I follow my heart ♪

00:17:42.032 --> 00:17:45.478
♪ The wind blows,
I am soaring into the sky ♪

00:17:45.479 --> 00:17:46.411
♪ As we meet ♪

00:17:46.417 --> 00:17:50.018
♪ One time you fight the fear,
fly to high ♪

00:17:50.054 --> 00:17:53.517
♪ Every drop of sweat
remembers how you have tried ♪

00:17:53.560 --> 00:17:55.311
♪ You are born to be the one ♪

00:17:55.312 --> 00:17:59.413
♪ Who realize all desires
until we start to fight ♪

00:17:59.434 --> 00:18:00.738
♪ Keep alive ♪

00:18:00.739 --> 00:18:04.086
♪ No matter what they said
you must believe in yourself ♪

00:18:04.087 --> 00:18:07.016
♪ You will breaking through the night ♪

00:18:07.017 --> 00:18:10.483
♪ Fire in your eyes shining so bright ♪

00:18:11.019 --> 00:18:12.118
♪ Oh ♪

00:18:12.745 --> 00:18:16.387
♪ You're always standing by my side ♪
